WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
[Soft original electronic score]

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.833
A curve. A stepped roofline. A line drawn towards the future.

00:00:07.683 --> 00:00:15.281
In Miami Beach, Art Deco became a defining architectural language during the city's growth in the nineteen thirties.

00:00:16.131 --> 00:00:21.885
Symmetry, geometric details, and rounded edges gave buildings a distinctive rhythm.

00:00:22.735 --> 00:00:30.103
These are contemporary illustrations of those ideas. History can help us look again at what is around us.

